==Description==
'''SugarRush Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 33 of the regular [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|1,150 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|96}} ({{Robux|72}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|17,840 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|2,712}} ({{Robux|2,036}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

'''SugarRush Nametag''' has rainbow gradient text surrounded by a rainbow outline. Multiple sweets of various colors fall behind it.

